{
  "info": {
    "name": "Red de apoyo",
    "description": "Invitaciones, tablero del integrante y aportes de la red de apoyo.\n\nRequiere los datos de `npx prisma db seed` (o `node prisma/seed-network.js`). Correr en orden: los logins guardan los tokens, \"Mis acompañamientos\" guarda el patientId de Tomás Ruiz e \"Invitar\" guarda memberId e invitationToken.\n\nErrores: `{ error, code }` con code invalid 400, forbidden 403, not_found 404, duplicate/used/email_taken 409, expired 410, rate_limited 429.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "atToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "supportToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "patientId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "invitationToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "contributionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "seedPendingToken",
      "value": "a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1"
    },
    {
      "key": "seedExpiredToken",
      "value": "b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2"
